{"id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-wtt.md","title":"弱真值表归约","display":"df-wtt — 弱真值表归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-wtt","aliases":["43-df-wtt"],"display":"df-wtt — 弱真值表归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.4.4, print p.16 / PDF p.36","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-wtt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-wtt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wtt — 弱真值表归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.4.4, print p.16 / PDF p.36"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exec}\">\\(\\operatorname{Exec}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 全定义；有限自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(x)\">\\(b(x)\\)</span> 同时是位置集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{j:j&lt;b(x)\\}\">\\(\\{j:j&lt;b(x)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\iff\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq b(x)\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,B,x,s,\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)(x),Q)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\iff\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{Computable}(b)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq b(x)\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,B,x,s,\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)(x),Q)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}B\\iff A\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\land B\\le_{\\rm wtt}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\rm wtt}B\\iff A\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\land B\\le_{\\rm wtt}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在停机运行并且全部查询位置小于b(x)，精确表达有限使用量界。候选不停止时存在量词失败，不调用未定义的使用量。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.4.4, print p.16 / PDF p.36。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\operatorname{Exec}$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]。$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 全定义；有限自然数 $b(x)$ 同时是位置集合 $\\{j:j<b(x)\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal O$；$\\operatorname{AsSequence}$ 采用 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\operatorname{Exec}$ 采用 [[43-df-oracle-computation]]。$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 全定义；有限自然数 $b(x)$ 同时是位置集合 $\\{j:j<b(x)\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSequence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exec}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{j:j<b(x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_{\\rm wtt}B\\iff\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;